":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2c4ed3e483d4a6a0349a2b56a3a45724f286f78490236d6cd21c6aa15e9bc96f","event_uuid":"75295393-dd76-418a-84c9-15277a70fb6e","position":{"commit_sha":"a57ccb30eed8bbe10f516deadd23a8a3708a4cb3","position":"1787452485188379001-75295393-dd76-418a-84c9-15277a70fb6e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"233eedb45eff9def90aa43734d3a63512c4d2b94bf927afaf1d40a9508ea5d70","event_uuid":"a3b8ae0f-c4e4-493f-b528-0962039954ab","position":{"commit_sha":"2544313451e239751c8e317b6835147b59a1122d","position":"1787452490694428001-a3b8ae0f-c4e4-493f-b528-0962039954ab"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"preexisting","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fix pushed as Gerrit change 2127 (commit 0e7ed9fd6dd, stacked on 2126/d93e): test.yml's README-quickstart and CLI-probe steps now carry the same if-present guards gerrit-verify.yaml grew in bug 1909; KNOWN GAP markers removed. New parity test test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py::test_golden_path_guards_match_the_verified_lane pins both lanes: every step running either script must carry its own -f guard with the canonical skip message. Awaiting LLM-Review+1 and Verified+1.","timestamp":1787437963338936001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"MERGED as Gerrit change 2127 -> main commit 7c5b3ead226 (LLM-Review+1, Verified+1, 0 unresolved). Evidence per AC: (1) both golden-path steps now carry -f guards naming their scripts, markers removed; completeness test test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py::test_completeness_every_gate_step_is_guarded_or_marked passing; (2) empty-tree skip test passing; (3) diff touches only the two steps in test.yml; new lane-parity pin test_golden_path_guards_match_the_verified_lane requires every step running either script in EITHER lane to carry its own guard + canonical message. make lint and make typecheck green. Origin attribution: the golden-path job landed unguarded in 26fd03040cd (ticket 0435-8dce-4e9f-4121), before the ee2a/1909 guard obligation existed — a latent gap the 1909 rollout fixed only in gerrit-verify.yaml, hence class=preexisting, caused-by=0435-8dce-4e9f-4121.","timestamp":1787445688559249001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787377581746745001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4a067e25-b691-440e-ad10-8903c1997c09","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"7e0d-7815-4425-4fdb"},{"link_uuid":"fed6335f-54d8-42c7-a0d9-923095834805","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8e02-79be-9ccc-4086"},{"link_uuid":"a3b8ae0f-c4e4-493f-b528-0962039954ab","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"0435-8dce-4e9f-4121"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`.github/workflows/test.yml` job `golden-path` runs `python scripts/check_readme_quickstart.py` (line 174) and `python scripts/probe_rebar.py` (line 176) with no predates-gate guard. The Verified lane guards the SAME two scripts at `gerrit-verify.yaml:324,333`. A push or PR whose base predates either script therefore reddens the mirror lane on a fault of the gate rather than of the change — the shape of bug `anxious-resistant-urson`, here as a one-lane-only fix that its twin never received.\n\n## Approach\nAdd the canonical `[ ! -f <path> ]` + \"change predates the gate\" guard to both steps, matching the wording used at `gerrit-verify.yaml:324,333`, then replace the two `# predates-gate-ok:` markers in `tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py`'s scope with the guards.\n\n## Scope\n`.github/workflows/test.yml`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Both golden-path steps carry an `-f` guard naming the script they run; checked by `pytest tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py::test_completeness_every_gate_step_is_guarded_or_marked` passing with the two markers REMOVED from test.yml.\n- [x] Both guarded bodies exit 0 and print the canonical message in an empty directory; checked by `pytest tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py::test_empty_tree_every_guarded_step_skips_cleanly`.\n- [x] No other test.yml behaviour changes; checked by `git diff origin/main -- .github/workflows/test.yml` touching only those two steps.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/test.yml","reason":"mirror the gerrit-verify.yaml -f guards onto the two golden-path steps and remove the KNOWN GAP markers"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py","reason":"add a cross-lane parity case pinning that both lanes guard the same golden-path scripts"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","8e02-79be-9ccc-4086"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"02f68595-1368-46c7-9dcd-30d321ba382c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e818-564e-d3b6-4eaa","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Guard the golden-path gate scripts in the test.yml mirror lane","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e004cc57-8e2a-40ec-b78f-056be34089fe","4